;TYPE:Custom
; Filament-specific end gcode 
;END gcode for filament
G1 Z66.15 F720 ; Move print head up
G1 X0 Y200 F3600 ; park
G1 Z114.15 F720 ; Move print head further up
G4 ; wait
M104 S0 ; turn off temperature
M140 S0 ; turn off heatbed
M107 ; turn off fan
M900 K0 ; reset LA
M84 ; disable motors
